        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>When you use the Step action, you can ignore difficult terrain caused by flooding, swamps, or quicksand. In addition, when you use the Acrobatics skill to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Balance] on narrow surfaces or uneven marshy ground, you aren't @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard], and if you roll a success on the Acrobatics check, you get a critical success instead.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "prerequisites": {
